 of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn the weekend, Xiao Li's family is planning a family gathering. Xiao Li excitedly says to her mother, \"Mom, can we go hiking? The scenery there is beautiful!\" The mother smiles and replies, \"That sounds like a good idea, let's ask dad's opinion.\" The father is looking at the seaside travel guide in his hand, then says to everyone, \"Actually, I prefer to go to the seaside, the scenery there is also beautiful, and we can play in the water at the seaside.\" Xiao Li nods after hearing this and says, \"Then we go to the seaside, next time we can go hiking.\" The mother also agrees, \"Okay, a seaside gathering sounds great.\" On the day of the gathering, the whole family goes to the seaside, everyone has a lot of fun, and Xiao Li also enjoys the fun of the seaside.\n\n[Question]\nDoes the mother know that the father wants to go to the seaside?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Knows\nB. Does not know","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3b4d6006945d2805e0d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368436703,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:40:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"22fae61167ef4cf19c31aacf5ede3200"}